#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.appdata.xml.in:7
msgid "GNOME Calculator"
msgstr "Calculadora de GNOME"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.appdata.xml.in:8
#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.desktop.in:4
msgid "Perform arithmetic, scientific or financial calculations"
msgstr "Fai cálculos aritméticos, científicos o financieros"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.appdata.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"GNOME Calculator is an application that solves mathematical equations. "
"Though it at first appears to be a simple calculator with only basic "
"arithmetic operations, you can switch into Advanced, Financial, or "
"Programming mode to find a surprising set of capabilities."
msgstr ""
"La calculadora de GNOME ye una aplicación que resuelve ecuaciones "
"matemátiques. A primera vista paez una calculadora cenciella con "
"aplicaciones aritmétiques básiques, pero pues activar los moos Avanzáu, "
"Financieru o Programación p'atopar un sorprendente conxuntu de posibilidaes."

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.appdata.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"The Advanced calculator supports many operations, including: logarithms, "
"factorials, trigonometric and hyperbolic functions, modulus division, "
"complex numbers, random number generation, prime factorization and unit "
"conversions."
msgstr ""
"La calculadora avanzada soporta munches operaciones, incluyendo logaritmos, "
"factoriales, funciones trigonométriques y hiperbóliques, módulu de la "
"división, númberos complexos, xeneración de númberos aleatorios, "
"factorización en númberos primos y conversión d'unidaes."

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.appdata.xml.in:22
msgid ""
"Financial mode supports several computations, including periodic interest "
"rate, present and future value, double declining and straight line "
"depreciation, and many others."
msgstr ""
"El mou financieru soporta dellos cálculos, incluyendo tasa d'interés "
"periódicu, valor presente y futuru, doble declinación y depreciación llinial "
"y abondes más"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.appdata.xml.in:27
msgid ""
"Programming mode supports conversion between common bases (binary, octal, "
"decimal, and hexadecimal), boolean algebra, one’s and two’s complementation, "
"character to character code conversion, and more."
msgstr ""
"El mou de programación soporta la conversión ente bases comunes (binaria, "
"octal, decimal y hexadecimal), álxebra booleana, complementu d'ún y de dos, "
"conversión de códigos carácter a cIntervaluarácter y más"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.appdata.xml.in:36
msgid "GNOME Calculator in Basic Mode"
msgstr "Calculadora de GNOME en mou básicu"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.appdata.xml.in:40
msgid "GNOME Calculator in Advanced Mode"
msgstr "Calculadora de GNOME en mou avanzáu"

